<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Data Intake Workspace | CATL Four-Layer Mapping Engine</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ url_for('static', filename='css/style.css') }}">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+SC:wght@300;400;500;700&family=Noto+Serif+SC:wght@400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>
    <header class="site-header">
        <div class="container header-container">
            <div class="logo-area">
                <h1>四层映射引擎 <span class="badge">HKU Research Prototype</span></h1>
            </div>
            <nav class="main-nav">
                <a href="/">首页 Overview</a>
                <a href="/intake" class="active">数据工作台 Intake</a>
                <a href="/outputs">输出中心 Outputs</a>
            </nav>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="container">
        <!-- Session Controls -->
        <div class="page-tools">
            <div>
                <h2>数据填写工作台</h2>
                <p class="subtitle">Session: <span id="current-session-id">None</span></p>
            </div>
            <div class="actions">
                <button class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="app.createSession('generic')">
                    Load Generic Template
                </button>
                <button class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="app.createSession('shenxing')">
                    Load Shenxing Case Demo
                </button>
                <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="app.calculateSession()" id="btn-calculate" disabled>
                    Calculate / Generate Outputs
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div id="status-bar" class="alert info" style="display:none; margin-top:15px;">
            <strong>Status:</strong> <span id="session-message">Ready</span>
        </div>

        <div class="alert warning" style="margin-top:15px;">
            <strong>填写说明：</strong>
            选择一个模板模式（通用模板或神行案例）开始填写。
            所有修改会自动保存为草稿。
            填写完成后，点击 <strong>Calculate / Generate Outputs</strong> 触发 Excel 重算并生成输出包。
            <br><br>
            <strong>边界声明：</strong> 本系统为研究原型，不构成法定电池护照申报，不替代 TÜV / NB / CAB 正式审计。
        </div>

        <!-- Intake Form -->
        <div class="intake-container">
            <aside class="intake-sidebar" id="intake-sidebar">
                <div style="padding:15px 18px;background:#f7fafc;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-bottom:none;">
                    <strong style="font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-secondary);">字段分类</strong>
                </div>
                <!-- Group nav injected by JS -->
            </aside>

            <section class="intake-form" id="intake-form">
                <!-- Form injected by JS -->
                <div class="empty-state" style="padding:60px;">
                    <p>点击上方按钮加载模板数据后，表单将显示在此处。</p>
                    <p style="color:var(--text-muted);font-size:0.85rem;">
                        Generic Template — 通用结构，适合任何 CATL 电池产品<br>
                        Shenxing Case — 神行案例快照，展示赛事叙事模式
                    </p>
                </div>
            </section>
        </div>

        <!-- Bottom action bar -->
        <div style="position:sticky;bottom:0;background:white;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;padding:15px 0;margin-top:40px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;z-index:50;" id="bottom-bar" hidden>
            <span style="color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.85rem;" id="save-status">Auto-saved</span>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;">
                <button class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="app.saveDraft()">Save Draft</button>
                <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="app.calculateSession()">Calculate &amp; Generate Outputs →</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <footer class="site-footer">
        <div class="container">
            <p>&copy; 2026 HKU-CATL Joint Lab Project. Research Prototype Only. Not a legal submission.</p>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <script src="{{ url_for('static', filename='js/main.js') }}"></script>
    <script>
        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
            const savedId = localStorage.getItem('catl_session_id');
            if (savedId) {
                app.state.sessionId = savedId;
                app.updateStatus('Restored session from localStorage: ' + savedId);
                document.getElementById('btn-calculate').disabled = false;
                const bottomBar = document.getElementById('bottom-bar');
                if (bottomBar) bottomBar.hidden = false;
            }
            app.loadIntakeSchema();
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
